  "description": "Oviond is a client reporting platform for marketing agencies. This connector gives Claude direct access to your Oviond account, allowing you to create, update, and analyze reports and dashboards without leaving the conversation.\n\nBuild reports and dashboards from scratch or from templates. Create clients, add pages, configure layouts, and place widgets including charts, tables, KPI scorecards, text, images, buttons, and embedded content. Reuse saved sections across multiple client reports to speed up reporting.\n\nConnect live marketing data from 100+ supported data sources, including Google Ads, Google Analytics 4, Meta Ads, Instagram, LinkedIn, TikTok Ads, Google Search Console, Shopify, Stripe, HubSpot, Mailchimp, and Google Business Profile. Claude automatically discovers each data source's available data views, metrics, and dimensions before configuring widgets, ensuring valid report configurations.\n\nAnalyze performance using your existing reports and dashboards. Ask questions about campaign performance, compare date ranges, identify trends, summarize KPIs, explain changes in performance, and retrieve underlying widget data, including totals, tables, and period-over-period comparisons.\n\nAutomate the rest of your reporting workflow by scheduling recurring email reports, generating PDFs, applying themes and white-label branding, configuring client currencies and time zones, managing calculated metrics and goals, administering team members, custom domains, and notifications.\n\nThe connector exposes 180 tools, including 59 read-only tools. Actions that modify data are clearly identified, and archive operations are recoverable rather than permanent, helping AI agents operate safely while still supporting full report management.",
